{"pageid": 766, "title": "Sophie Mahoney", "revid": 1904, "categories": ["Characters", "Humans", "Deceased", "Children", "Archer's Peak", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Sophie Mahoney</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/2/2c/TommySophieMahoney.png/revision/latest?cb=20241215165848\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"TommySophieMahoney\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/2/2c/TommySophieMahoney.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215165848\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/2/2c/TommySophieMahoney.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215165848 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/2/2c/TommySophieMahoney.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241215165848 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"TommySophieMahoney\" width=\"270\" height=\"381\" data-image-key=\"TommySophieMahoney.png\" data-image-name=\"TommySophieMahoney.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"born\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Born</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2008<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC15&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC15-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Deceased\" title=\"Category:Deceased\">Deceased</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cause_of_death\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Cause of Death</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Killed by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype mother</span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC5&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC5-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mr._Mahoney\" title=\"Mr. Mahoney\">Mr. Mahoney</a> <small>(father)</small><br /><p><a href=\"/wiki/Ms._Mahoney\" title=\"Ms. Mahoney\">Ms. Mahoney</a> <small>(mother)</small><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a> <small>(brother)</small><br /></p></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_2\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 2\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #2</a> <small>(pictured)</small></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_15\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 15\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #15</a> <small>(grave)</small></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Sophie Mahoney</b> was a 12-year-old girl living in <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak, Wisconsin</a> during the 2020 <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak incident (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX2luY2lkZW50P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak incident</span>. She was kidnapped and killed by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype mother</span>, which used her body parts to feed its <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">children</span>. Her disappearance would prompt her brother, <a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy</a>, to investigate <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a>'s hunt.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Sophie was a young 12-year-old Caucasian girl.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_2\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 2\">Issue #2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_5\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 5\">Issue #5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_14\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 14\">Issue #14</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"e0857ef721686a116ca6d69c68f542ff\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_14_Cover-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:120px; top:0.5px;\"><